{"id":"1ac0d6c23b975791","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-pure-injective.md","title":"Pure Injective Module","display":"df-pure-injective — Pure Injective Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pure-injective","aliases":["58-df-pure-injective"],"display":"df-pure-injective — Pure Injective Module","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pure-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pure-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pure-injective — Pure Injective Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25e593b1b8714c23\" href=\"?note=25e593b1b8714c23\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md\">../batch04/58-df-tensor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a commutative unital ring and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P,K,i,f,g\\in V\">\\(M,N,P,K,i,f,g\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Module}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Module}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureInjective}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PureInjective}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,N,P)\n\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Module}(K,R)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Injective}_S\n(i\\otimes_R\\operatorname{id}_K,N\\otimes_RK,P\\otimes_RK)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(i,N,P)\n\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Module}(K,R)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Injective}_S\n(i\\otimes_R\\operatorname{id}_K,N\\otimes_RK,P\\otimes_RK)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PureInjective}_S(M,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\n\\land\\forall N,P,i,f\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,N,M,R)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\exists g\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(g,P,M,R)\n\\land g\\circ i=f\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}injective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PureInjective}_S(M,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\n\\land\\forall N,P,i,f\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{PureMonomorphism}_S(i,N,P,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,N,M,R)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\exists g\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(g,P,M,R)\n\\land g\\circ i=f\n\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure injectivity is injectivity relative to pure monomorphisms; the ring and module variance are explicit.</li>\n<li>Every module has a pure-injective envelope, but the former asserted product-of-injective-hulls classification is not valid over an arbitrary ring.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"25e593b1b8714c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locati